1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,818
PaalKural.

2
00:00:01,768 --> 00:00:06,326
A Tamil voice ledger for a milk line that never sleeps.

3
00:00:06,436 --> 00:00:12,607
At five decibels, with babble and cans, both live Prisma listens agree.

4
00:00:12,557 --> 00:00:17,596
The sheet pre-fills, and the operator confirms the Tamil readback.

5
00:00:17,596 --> 00:00:20,787
One entry, with an audit hash.

6
00:00:20,908 --> 00:00:23,290
Fifteen decibels.

7
00:00:23,240 --> 00:00:29,035
Raw hears fat four point seven; the conditioned listen hears four point zero.

8
00:00:29,035 --> 00:00:33,969
Both validate, so the sheet stamps check and blocks the log.

9
00:00:33,969 --> 00:00:39,048
The operator keeps the raw value, and nothing lands silently.

10
00:00:39,172 --> 00:00:42,323
The evidence lab keeps two books.

11
00:00:42,273 --> 00:00:51,348
The frozen local benchmark reports the negative result; the live provider check reruns the same matrix through Gnani Prisma.

12
00:00:51,348 --> 00:00:57,911
192 calls, no errors, no silent errors at any line level.

13
00:00:58,012 --> 00:01:03,194
Prisma and Timbre are wired live through a participant-supplied key.

14
00:01:03,144 --> 00:01:08,365
The frozen benchmark stays local so its claim can be reproduced.

15
00:01:08,365 --> 00:01:11,998
Synthetic voices, synthetic pours.
